# Written by PyInstaller, not by hand
s3duck.spec

# Things the app writes next to the files it handles, in case it is run
# against this checkout: interrupted transfers (.s3duckpart + .meta sidecar),
# an exported manifest, and a saved problem report or session log export.
# The live session log goes to ~/.config/s3duck/, not here.
*.s3duckpart
*.s3duckpart.meta
*-manifest.csv
s3duck-report.txt
s3duck-log-*.txt
